SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieHoldItRightThere:
	.string "ARCHIE: Hold it right there.$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieSoItWasYou:
	.string "ARCHIE: Fufufu…\n"
	.string "So it was you, after all.$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieBeholdKyogre:
	.string "ARCHIE: Behold! KYOGRE!\p"
	.string "The ultimate producer. An ocean of\n"
	.string "sparkling water!\p"
	.string "I have waited so long for this day…$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieYouMustDisappear:
	.string "ARCHIE: You chased me all the way here.\n"
	.string "Impressive.\p"
	.string "But now you must disappear.\p"
	.string "Nothing personal. It's business.$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieDefeat:
	.string "What?! I lost to a child?!\p"
	.string "Terrible for the brand!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWithThisRedOrb:
	.string "ARCHIE: Fufufu… I commend you.\p"
	.string "But I have the RED ORB!\p"
	.string "With it, KYOGRE will…$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_RedOrbShinesByItself:
	.string "The RED ORB suddenly began shining by\n"
	.string "itself!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWhereDidKyogreGo:
	.string "ARCHIE: What?!\p"
	.string "I didn't touch anything! Why is the RED\n"
	.string "ORB…\p"
	.string "Where did my KYOGRE go?! That's my\n"
	.string "whole supply chain!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieAMessageFromOutside:
	.string "ARCHIE: Hm? A message from the grunts\n"
	.string "outside… This had better be good news.$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWhatRainingTooHard:
	.string "ARCHIE: Yes, what is it?\p"
	.string "Raining heavily? Good. That's the plan.\p"
	.string "Free water! We just add bubbles.\p"
	.string "What?!\p"
	.string "Far harder than planned? You're in\n"
	.string "danger?\p"
	.string "That can't be…\p"
	.string "Hold your position! And keep bottling!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWhyDidKyogreDisappear:
	.string "ARCHIE: Something's wrong…\p"
	.string "The RED ORB should control KYOGRE…\p"
	.string "Why did it leave? My supplier! Why?!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_MaxieWhatHaveYouWrought:
	.string "MAXIE: ARCHIE… You woke KYOGRE, didn't\n"
	.string "you?\p"
	.string "If this rain never stops, there's no\n"
	.string "land left.\p"
	.string "No land, no peppers!\p"
	.string "No peppers, no hot sauce!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieDontGetAllHighAndMighty:
	.string "ARCHIE: D-don't get high and mighty\n"
	.string "with me!\p"
	.string "You're the one who made GROUDON angry!\p"
	.string "As long as I have the RED ORB, I can\n"
	.string "control KYOGRE…\p"
	.string "I should be able to…$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_MaxieWeDontHaveTimeToArgue:
	.string "MAXIE: No time to argue!\p"
	.string "Go outside and look!\p"
	.string "Nobody buys sparkling water in a flood!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_MaxieComeOnPlayer:
	.string "MAXIE: {PLAYER}, come on, you have to\n"
	.string "get out of here too! Customers don't\l"
	.string "grow on trees!$"
